<title>USA: Bristol-Myers Squibb Co Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Bristol-Myers Squibb Co Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		  $1.43     loss	 $0.28</p>
<p> Net profit		716,000     loss     142,000</p>
<p> Revs		    3,955,000		3,608,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  501,000		  505,000</p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr profit		  $5.68   profit	 $3.58</p>
<p> Net profit	    2,850,000   profit   1,812,000</p>
<p> Revs		   15,065,000	     13,767,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  502,000		  506,000</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 and year 1995 nets include pretax charge of $950 million for breast implant litigation, and pretax charge of $310 million for restructuring.</p>
</text>
